{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q5515088","formula":"C₁₇H₁₅N₃O₂","hill":"C17H15N3O2","elements":["H","C","N","O"],"composition":{"C":17.0,"H":15.0,"N":3.0,"O":2.0},"names":{"en":"GYKI-2466","uk":"GYKI-52,466"},"descriptions":{"en":"GYKI 52466 is a 2,3-benzodiazepine that acts as an ionotropic glutamate receptor antagonist, which is a non-competitive AMPA receptor antagonist (IC50 values are 10-20, ~ 450 and >> 50 μM for AMPA-, kainate- and NMDA-induced responses respectively), orally-active anticonvulsant, and skeletal muscle relaxant. Unlike conventional 1,4-benzodiazepines, GYKI 52466 and related 2,3-benzodiazepines do not act on GABAA receptors. Like other AMPA receptor antagonists, GYKI 52466 has anticonvulsant and neuroprotective properties.","uk":"GYKI-52,466 — 2,3-бензодіазепін, що діє на іонотропні глутаматні рецептори, і є їхнім неконкурентним антагоністом: значення IC50 10-20, ~ 450 та >> 50 μM для АМРА-, каїнатних, та NMDA-рецепторів відповідно. При пероральному застосуванні завдає сильну антиконвульсантну та нейропротекторну дію на організм (як і багато інших антагоністів АМРА-рецептора). Також може виявляти ефект м'язової релаксації."},"fame":7,"pubchemCid":3538,"mass":293.32,"charge":0,"smiles":"CC1=NN=C(C2=CC3=C(C=C2C1)OCO3)C4=CC=C(C=C4)N","inchikey":"LFBZZHVSGAHQPP-UHFFFAOYSA-N","iupac":"4-(8-methyl-9H-[1,3]dioxolo[4,5-h][2,3]benzodiazepin-5-yl)aniline","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"pubchem","ref":"3538","atoms":37,"license":"PubChem (NIH), public data"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":-3.882,"y":2.204,"z":-0.408,"el":"O"},{"x":-2.111,"y":3.024,"z":1.005,"el":"O"},{"x":0.682,"y":-2.302,"z":0.484,"el":"N"},{"x":-0.465,"y":-3.038,"z":0.77,"el":"N"},{"x":5.622,"y":1.615,"z":-0.408,"el":"N"},{"x":-1.643,"y":-0.695,"z":-0.697,"el":"C"},{"x":-0.603,"y":-0.202,"z":0.126,"el":"C"},{"x":-1.531,"y":